# New game path for the D2 captures; timings are vblanks at 60 Hz.
wait state 2
wait 600
capture title
press CROSS 6
wait 240
capture gname-select-character
press CROSS 6
wait 180
capture gname-select-weapon
press CROSS 6
wait state 3
wait 300
capture gname-name-entry
press CROSS 6
wait state 5
wait 180
capture wsel-room
press CROSS 6
wait 120
capture wsel-prompt
press CROSS 6
wait 120
capture wsel-cursor
press CROSS 6
wait 120
capture wsel-cursor-confirmed
mash CROSS 40 state 1
wait 10
capture wmap-loading
wait 215
capture wmap-mailbox
wait 45
capture wmap-mailbox-carried
wait 180
capture wmap-place-mailbox-prompt
press CROSS 6
wait 30
press CROSS 6
wait 300
capture wmap-land-flash
wait 150
capture wmap-home-rising
wait 120
capture wmap-home-dark
wait 140
capture wmap-board-home
mash CROSS 40 marker field scene 857
mash CROSS 40 marker field map 18
wait 240
press DOWN 120
press LEFT 120
capture field-home
scene 71 0
mash CROSS 40 marker field scene 71
wait 300
capture field-battle-scene
battle
wait 60
capture field-battle
mash CROSS 20 marker field battle 0
wait 120
capture field-battle-end
